  "content": "\n\n# Расширенные зачарования для Молота\n\n**Этот датапак и мод** расширяет зачарования Молота, добавляя ему зачарования, доступные для Меча.\n\n**‎◾Пример:**\n\n![Expanded Mace Enchantings](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8784ab678db56fb92cab7fb9996770b5328deb95.jpeg)\n\n\n## Подробности📝\n\n- **Expanded Mace Enchantings** **совместим** с версиями **1.21 по 1.21.11**\n- **Expanded Mace Enchantings** добавляет новое **(расширение)** на стол зачарований🌐\n- **Expanded Mace Enchantings** совместим с любыми **датапаками зачарований**\n- **Нет**, распаковывать скачанный файл не требуется 🗂️\n\n## Другие проекты:\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-armor-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/TM5K3dNM/ezgif-com-speed-43.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (43)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/project/expanded-weapon-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bML9W70B/ezgif-com-speed-44.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (44)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-trident-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VcwSJqRJ/Expanded-Trident-Enchants-Logo.jpg\" alt=\"Expanded Trident Enchants Logo\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-mace-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LXv2pS15/Expanded-Mace-Enchants-Logo-2.jpg\" alt=\"Expanded Mace Enchants Logo (2)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-axe-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Fqxsn0qL/ezgif-com-speed-47.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (47)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-bow-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VWLkm7bC/ezgif-com-speed-48.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (48)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-crossbow-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PzT0xXgD/ezgif-com-speed-49.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com speed (49)\" border=\"0\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/expanded-spear-enchantings\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tTJBJp9c/ezgif-com-resize-1.gif\" alt=\"ezgif com resize (1)\" border=\"0\"></a>",
